  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.26 Fossil fuel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.26 “Fossil fuel” means natural gas, petroleum, coal, or any form of solid, liquid, or gaseous fuel derived wholly, or in part, from such material.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36 (formerly Env-A 3203.27)",
